# EmailJS Configuration
# 1. Sign up for free at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail) -> Copy your Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template -> Copy your Template ID
# 4. Under Account > API Keys -> Copy your Public Key
# 5. Create a file named `.env` in the root folder (same level as package.json) and paste your keys:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
